  "interpretation_zh": "在已开封 Case 5 的 546 个单元和 13 套虚拟九相机几何上，potential-normal 主候选即使继续到 K14 仍为 0/546、0/13，因此该表示关闭。与此同时，同一冻结重放中的既有 Low-64 observation-only 确定性对照在 K11 首次达到 546/546、13/13，并把逻辑精确调用从 K16 参考的 16A+16A^T 降为 12A+11A^T。后者是值得进入一次结果前固定确认门的 control headroom，不是 learned algorithm 或外部成功。",
  "interpretation_en": "Across 546 opened Case 5 cells and 13 virtual nine-camera geometries, the potential-normal primary remains at 0/546 cells and 0/13 rigs even after PCGLS K14, so that representation is closed. In the same frozen replay, the existing observation-only deterministic Low-64 control first reaches 546/546 cells and 13/13 rigs at K11, reducing the logical exact-call ledger from the K16 reference's 16A+16A^T to 12A+11A^T. This is control headroom worth one preregistered confirmation gate, not a learned algorithm or external success.",
  "route_action_zh": "停止 potential-normal 的阈值、秩、深度和网络扩建。下一候选固定为 Low-64 K11，不再调表示或深度；只有在一个结果前未开的等价公开工况上再次通过 matched-accuracy 与独立复算，才允许测 fresh wall/RSS 或讨论更一般的算法主张。",
  "route_action_en": "Stop extending the potential-normal threshold, rank, depth, or network. Fix Low-64 K11 as the next candidate without retuning representation or depth. Fresh wall/RSS or broader algorithm claims remain closed until it again clears matched accuracy and independent recomputation on an equivalent previously unopened public condition.",
